Dear Applicants,

We are writing to inform you of a revision to the FY2026 Community Development Grant application guidelines.

CHANGE: Narrative Page Limit
- Previous: 15 pages maximum
- Revised: 12 pages maximum

This change is effective immediately and applies to all applications in preparation. The revised limit reflects reviewer feedback that more concise narratives allow for more thorough evaluation within our review timeline.

All other application requirements remain unchanged. Please adjust your narrative accordingly.

If you have questions, contact Dr. Amara Okafor at a.okafor@fieldstone-fdn.org.

Best regards,
